WEBVTT

00:00:01.430 --> 00:00:02.850
Sekijo.

00:00:03.100 --> 00:00:05.440
Would you like to sleep over
at my house tonight?

00:00:08.020 --> 00:00:09.110
<i>What?</i>

00:00:15.160 --> 00:00:18.740
W-Well, if you insist! Jeez!

00:00:21.580 --> 00:00:23.000
Uruka's great idea!

00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:27.790
"Girls Galore Pajama Study Session
at Rizurin's House!"

00:00:27.790 --> 00:00:30.300
Yay! The title is so long!

00:00:31.590 --> 00:00:34.300
Yeah, but what am I doing here?

00:00:34.300 --> 00:00:38.390
Well, you're always staring at Ri
in the school library,

00:00:35.220 --> 00:00:38.050
<i>Rizu Ogata, Rizu Ogata, Rizu Ogata,
Rizu Ogata, Rizu Ogata...</i>

00:00:38.390 --> 00:00:41.100
so I figured you'd be happy if we invited you.

00:00:42.850 --> 00:00:44.850
I don't stare at her at all!

00:00:44.850 --> 00:00:47.560
And in the first place,
what's a pajama study session?

00:00:52.110 --> 00:00:55.320
OGATA UDON

00:00:52.610 --> 00:00:55.320
Pajamas! That's a fantastic idea!

00:00:55.910 --> 00:00:56.780
Sekijo.

00:00:57.070 --> 00:00:58.700
Huh? Yes?

00:00:58.700 --> 00:01:01.540
I don't understand this character's emotions.

00:01:01.540 --> 00:01:03.910
I-I don't get this long translation.

00:01:03.910 --> 00:01:06.000
This formula is kind of confusing...

00:01:06.210 --> 00:01:08.130
Wait, not all at once...

00:01:08.130 --> 00:01:09.170
- This one.
- This, too.

00:01:08.130 --> 00:01:10.960
ENGLISH
WRITING SUPPLEMENT

00:01:08.920 --> 00:01:10.960
FOUNDATIONS OF MATH
WORKBOOK

00:01:09.170 --> 00:01:10.630
Sekijo.

00:01:15.470 --> 00:01:17.300
Are you okay, Sawachin?

00:01:17.300 --> 00:01:19.090
Sorry. We couldn't help it.

00:01:19.090 --> 00:01:20.430
I apologize.

00:01:20.430 --> 00:01:25.060
We hit you with a barrage of questions
like we always do with Yuiga.

00:01:25.060 --> 00:01:28.190
What? He's always going through that gauntlet?

00:01:28.190 --> 00:01:29.520
Um...

00:01:30.150 --> 00:01:33.440
Well, maybe we're even less reserved
with Nariyuki.

00:01:35.150 --> 00:01:38.320
So he's fine despite being peppered
by all your annoying questions.

00:01:38.700 --> 00:01:42.990
To have a tutor like that...
You guys don't know how lucky you are.

00:01:50.330 --> 00:01:55.550
But Nariyuki Yuiga is the type
to carry on big burdens in the future.

00:01:55.550 --> 00:02:00.050
I don't know if he's a pushover
or just gets caught up in stuff too easily.

00:02:00.050 --> 00:02:02.470
But I feel sorry
for whoever becomes his girlfriend.

00:03:36.860 --> 00:03:41.070
EPISODE 13:
THE LIGHT
IN A GENIUS'S EYE
IS ALL X

00:03:42.660 --> 00:03:43.780
Hey, look!

00:03:52.040 --> 00:03:54.830
Yay! Yay!

00:03:54.830 --> 00:03:56.630
Festival!

00:03:56.630 --> 00:04:00.710
Sorry, Nariyuki. Having you come with us
when you've got studying to do.

00:04:00.970 --> 00:04:04.180
It's fine, Mom. I needed a break, anyway.

00:04:05.930 --> 00:04:10.220
<i>Well, a casual stroll around here
shouldn't take too long.</i>

00:04:10.220 --> 00:04:12.430
<i>Once I'm home, I'll jump right back into it.</i>

00:04:12.560 --> 00:04:15.480
Huh? It's Yuiga!

00:04:16.360 --> 00:04:17.230
Nariyuki?

00:04:17.610 --> 00:04:19.440
Furuhashi! Takemoto!

00:04:19.440 --> 00:04:21.190
You guys are here too?

00:04:21.190 --> 00:04:23.360
Yeah, just for a change of pace.

00:04:24.070 --> 00:04:26.410
Yuiga, is this your little brother and sister?

00:04:26.410 --> 00:04:27.160
Yeah.

00:04:27.160 --> 00:04:29.830
- I'm Kazuki!
- I'm Hazuki!

00:04:29.950 --> 00:04:31.080
I'm Hanae!

00:04:31.080 --> 00:04:32.200
Mom!

00:04:37.710 --> 00:04:41.880
Say, Yuiga, what do you think of our yukatas?
Do they suit us?

00:04:42.420 --> 00:04:43.510
H-Hey!

00:04:44.090 --> 00:04:47.390
Oh, y-you both look good in them.

00:04:47.890 --> 00:04:51.020
Furuhashi, especially,
you look pretty natural in it.

00:04:51.270 --> 00:04:53.270
Like a traditional Japanese stage actress.

00:04:54.560 --> 00:04:56.230
R-Really?

00:04:56.230 --> 00:04:59.110
<i>Jeez, there's no point in complimenting me.</i>

00:04:59.110 --> 00:05:00.690
<i>Not that I mind.</i>

00:05:00.940 --> 00:05:02.940
Natural?

00:05:02.940 --> 00:05:06.660
The body type that looks good
in a yukata was...

00:05:08.070 --> 00:05:11.620
<i>Be careful, little ones.
One more remark and you're in trouble.</i>

00:05:11.990 --> 00:05:13.790
<i>He said it looks good on me.</i>

00:05:13.790 --> 00:05:16.040
<i>Nariyuki said it looks good!</i>

00:05:16.040 --> 00:05:19.170
<i>It was hard to put on,
but I'm glad I made the effort!</i>

00:05:19.170 --> 00:05:22.300
<i>Nariyuki said it looks good!
That makes me so happy!</i>

00:05:22.300 --> 00:05:24.840
<i>Your girly aura
is spilling out everywhere, Uruka!</i>

00:05:27.090 --> 00:05:31.810
Nariyuki, why don't you go ahead
and join your friends?

00:05:32.390 --> 00:05:33.890
Huh? What the heck?

00:05:38.270 --> 00:05:41.860
Sorry, I forgot!
I wanted to buy some takoyaki!

00:05:42.780 --> 00:05:44.860
You and Uruka should keep walking around!

00:05:45.440 --> 00:05:46.900
Hey, Furuhashi!

00:05:50.530 --> 00:05:52.950
What was up with Furuhashi?

00:05:53.040 --> 00:05:56.460
I don't know.
I would've been happy to go with her.

00:05:59.630 --> 00:06:04.840
<i>That hairstyle suits you. I mean, it's cute.</i>

00:06:06.170 --> 00:06:07.590
<i>No, that has nothing to do with it!</i>

00:06:07.590 --> 00:06:10.640
<i>How arrogant do you have to be
to think it's because of your comment?</i>

00:06:10.640 --> 00:06:12.680
Hey, Nariyuki, look at this!

00:06:13.350 --> 00:06:15.520
My tongue is all pink!

00:06:16.890 --> 00:06:19.310
Oh, do you want a bite, too?

00:06:19.310 --> 00:06:22.020
N-No! I'm totally fine!

00:06:22.820 --> 00:06:25.730
<i>Like I said, stop being delusional!</i>

00:06:25.730 --> 00:06:27.950
Oh, if it isn't Teacher!

00:06:28.820 --> 00:06:31.530
Good evening, Yuiga and Takemoto.

00:06:31.530 --> 00:06:37.410
OGATA UDON

00:06:31.870 --> 00:06:34.830
Ogata, and Ogata's dad!
I didn't know you had a food stand here!

00:06:34.830 --> 00:06:37.410
Yeah! And as you can see, business is booming!

00:06:37.410 --> 00:06:43.290
ROWDY ROWDY

00:06:37.960 --> 00:06:40.000
- I'll have three orders of grilled udon!
- Got it!

00:06:40.000 --> 00:06:41.330
I'll have five orders!

00:06:41.330 --> 00:06:43.290
All right. Sit tight!

00:06:43.500 --> 00:06:46.210
- No vegetables!
- Sure thing!

00:06:49.550 --> 00:06:54.310
It's time for me to make the deliveries,
but are you okay here by yourself, Dad?

00:06:54.310 --> 00:06:57.060
Hell yeah! I'll get through this if it kills me!

00:07:00.480 --> 00:07:01.230
That's too many!

00:07:01.480 --> 00:07:03.060
Isn't my grilled udon ready yet?

00:07:03.060 --> 00:07:04.440
I want four orders!

00:07:04.440 --> 00:07:07.690
Oh no, Dad, a bag broke!

00:07:10.030 --> 00:07:12.740
Hey, you're good at that, young lady!

00:07:13.820 --> 00:07:17.080
Cooking is right up my alley.
Keep it coming and I'll keep cutting!

00:07:22.000 --> 00:07:24.340
<i>I hope it's working out for Uruka.</i>

00:07:28.460 --> 00:07:30.010
The stars are beautiful.

00:07:30.010 --> 00:07:34.220
Just by coming a little closer to the mountains,
I can see them so clearly.

00:07:37.060 --> 00:07:39.230
Hello! Ogata Udon here!

00:07:40.810 --> 00:07:43.560
Here you are, two orders of fried udon!

00:07:43.560 --> 00:07:44.810
Th-Thank you.

00:07:44.810 --> 00:07:46.860
All right, where to next, Ogata?

00:07:46.860 --> 00:07:49.320
Next up is the goldfish scooping stall,
five stalls down!

00:07:49.490 --> 00:07:51.780
- After that, there's the takoyaki stall!
- And then?

00:07:51.780 --> 00:07:55.490
The shaved ice stall. And then, after that,
the candy-coated fruit stall!

00:07:55.740 --> 00:07:58.240
Thanks for coming by in this heat.

00:07:58.540 --> 00:08:00.200
Here, on the house.

00:08:03.500 --> 00:08:08.300
Stare...

00:08:05.000 --> 00:08:06.630
Finally got through half the list.

00:08:07.460 --> 00:08:09.340
Oh, you want to eat them now?

00:08:10.800 --> 00:08:11.720
Here.

00:08:17.350 --> 00:08:18.220
Seriously?

00:08:24.020 --> 00:08:28.070
<i>She's cute, like a little animal.</i>

00:08:30.360 --> 00:08:31.940
We're done!

00:08:31.940 --> 00:08:32.900
I appreciate it.

00:08:33.490 --> 00:08:38.120
Well, I'm heading back.
Don't overdo it, Yuiga. Take a break!

00:08:38.780 --> 00:08:39.870
Hey, Ogata!

00:08:42.620 --> 00:08:44.580
SHOOTING GALLERY

00:09:01.140 --> 00:09:04.890
That masked beauty is amazing!
Although I don't know if she is...

00:09:04.890 --> 00:09:08.770
She knocked over all of the prizes
with 100% accuracy!

00:09:09.110 --> 00:09:11.230
She really is a mysterious beauty!

00:09:11.230 --> 00:09:13.780
- I wish she'd shoot me!
- I wish she'd step on me!

00:09:15.570 --> 00:09:18.740
What are you doing, Ms. Kirisu?

00:09:20.870 --> 00:09:23.120
You are Ms. Kirisu, aren't you?

00:09:28.080 --> 00:09:29.590
Ms. Kirisu!

00:09:35.760 --> 00:09:39.890
In other words, the headmaster ordered you
to blend in with the crowd

00:09:39.890 --> 00:09:42.100
to monitor the students?

00:09:42.100 --> 00:09:43.520
Humiliating.

00:09:43.520 --> 00:09:46.350
It's humiliating to get
a piggyback ride from a student.

00:09:47.600 --> 00:09:50.810
<i>Oh, I guess she doesn't remember
that last time?</i>

00:09:51.230 --> 00:09:54.150
Come on, Ms. Kirisu, don't pout.

00:09:54.150 --> 00:09:56.070
We've arrived at the first-aid station.

00:09:56.070 --> 00:09:58.110
I'm not pouting.

00:09:58.110 --> 00:09:59.820
<i>What a pain.</i>

00:10:00.450 --> 00:10:02.990
Yo, Junior. Did you get hurt?

00:10:03.160 --> 00:10:04.620
<i>She's here too?</i>

00:10:04.620 --> 00:10:06.410
No, not me.

00:10:06.410 --> 00:10:09.250
Oh, just Ms. Mafuyu.

00:10:09.250 --> 00:10:11.920
What do you mean by "just," Kominami?

00:10:13.340 --> 00:10:17.010
Both me and my dad
are a bit busy at the moment...

00:10:17.300 --> 00:10:18.760
Junior, take care of her!

00:10:20.640 --> 00:10:24.100
Um, how about the idea
of doing this yourself, Ms. Kirisu?

00:10:24.100 --> 00:10:25.640
Impossible. I'm too scared.

00:10:27.140 --> 00:10:29.350
P-Please take care of it.

00:10:29.560 --> 00:10:32.860
S-Sure. Okay then, here I go.

00:10:34.940 --> 00:10:37.440
<i>She smells good, like an adult scent.</i>

00:10:37.700 --> 00:10:38.860
<i>Dummy, calm down!</i>

00:10:38.860 --> 00:10:41.120
<i>If she knew what you were thinking,
you'd be a dead man!</i>

00:10:41.450 --> 00:10:44.290
<i>Clear your mind, clear your mind.</i>

00:10:44.580 --> 00:10:44.790
POKE

00:10:47.330 --> 00:10:53.000
FIRST-AID STATION

00:10:47.870 --> 00:10:50.120
Ms. Kirisu, please don't make weird noises!

00:10:50.120 --> 00:10:51.170
How rude!

00:10:51.790 --> 00:10:53.000
Ms. Kirisu!

00:11:01.800 --> 00:11:03.970
Oh no! Will I make the last train?

00:11:04.260 --> 00:11:07.600
What am I doing? I'm such an idiot!

00:11:15.400 --> 00:11:19.570
Mom! Where are you?

00:11:22.160 --> 00:11:24.700
<i>Oh, great.</i>

00:11:24.990 --> 00:11:30.000
<i>There, there.</i>

00:11:24.990 --> 00:11:30.000
<i>PAT PAT</i>

00:11:31.580 --> 00:11:34.960
I apologize for making you help out so late.

00:11:35.210 --> 00:11:37.880
That's okay. I can still catch the last train.

00:11:38.130 --> 00:11:42.380
Maybe I relied on you too much
because you're my daughter's boyfriend.

00:11:42.380 --> 00:11:44.720
Oh, well, think nothing of it.

00:11:44.850 --> 00:11:47.100
<i>I almost forgot about the "boyfriend" charade.</i>

00:11:47.520 --> 00:11:49.230
Let's go home, Asumi.

00:11:50.350 --> 00:11:51.770
Hey, Junior.

00:11:52.600 --> 00:11:56.610
For the next festival,
I want to go with you, just the two of us.

00:11:57.570 --> 00:11:58.360
Just kidding.

00:11:58.570 --> 00:12:00.740
You always do that to me!

00:12:02.030 --> 00:12:03.280
See you!

00:12:05.370 --> 00:12:07.410
Sheesh, that girl.

00:12:07.410 --> 00:12:10.580
Anyway, the last train is leaving soon.
If I don't hurry up...

00:12:14.170 --> 00:12:18.420
Mom! Sis! Where are you?

00:12:18.920 --> 00:12:21.170
<i>Oh, come on!</i>

00:12:21.470 --> 00:12:22.800
Kana!

00:12:22.880 --> 00:12:24.590
Kana!

00:12:24.590 --> 00:12:27.350
Where are you? Answer me!

00:12:27.560 --> 00:12:30.810
Sis! Mom!

00:12:31.270 --> 00:12:32.270
Kana!

00:12:32.270 --> 00:12:33.980
Oh, thank goodness!

00:12:33.980 --> 00:12:37.020
I didn't know what to do
when you both got lost.

00:12:37.190 --> 00:12:41.780
Know what? That mister over there
helped me look for you!

00:12:42.530 --> 00:12:44.610
Huh? He's gone!

00:12:44.910 --> 00:12:46.030
Huh?

00:12:46.030 --> 00:12:47.700
That's a coincidence, Kana.

00:12:47.700 --> 00:12:54.580
You know, just now,
a beautiful girl helped me look for Mom!

00:13:04.470 --> 00:13:06.390
I didn't make it.

00:13:08.600 --> 00:13:09.970
What should I do?

00:13:09.970 --> 00:13:10.850
Huh?

00:13:16.100 --> 00:13:17.520
Yuiga?

00:13:17.860 --> 00:13:19.060
Furuhashi.

00:13:19.270 --> 00:13:20.320
What are you doing here?

00:13:20.520 --> 00:13:22.610
Oh, well, I...

00:13:23.190 --> 00:13:26.110
<i>"I was looking at the stars
and missed the last train."</i>

00:13:26.110 --> 00:13:28.370
<i>That's way too dumb and I can't say that.</i>

00:13:28.740 --> 00:13:36.000
Y-Yuiga, sometimes girls have secrets that
they really can't be telling anyone about.

00:13:36.210 --> 00:13:38.710
I-I understand, Master!

00:13:42.590 --> 00:13:45.720
I don't think any taxis are coming.

00:13:45.720 --> 00:13:50.350
Let's walk to a main street.
Maybe we can find some there.

00:14:00.360 --> 00:14:05.360
<i>We've been walking for a while know, but hardly
any cars have gone by, never mind taxis.</i>

00:14:05.530 --> 00:14:06.490
Ouch!

00:14:06.950 --> 00:14:08.320
Ow.

00:14:08.320 --> 00:14:10.410
What is it, Furuhashi? Are you okay?

00:14:10.620 --> 00:14:14.750
Yeah. I'm not used to wearing geta,
so it kind of chafes.

00:14:15.040 --> 00:14:17.710
<i>She probably shouldn't be walking anymore.</i>

00:14:17.710 --> 00:14:21.340
<i>But this far in the country,
there aren't any diners or karaoke places.</i>

00:14:21.790 --> 00:14:22.710
Is that...

00:14:24.210 --> 00:14:25.210
An inn?

00:14:25.210 --> 00:14:26.920
ASUMA INN

00:14:27.010 --> 00:14:31.300
I'm sorry. We only have one room left.

00:14:32.180 --> 00:14:33.260
Oh, really?

00:14:34.010 --> 00:14:37.390
Then I'll walk home. You take the room.

00:14:37.390 --> 00:14:41.150
- You're giving up too soon!
- Well, there's no other alternative!

00:14:41.150 --> 00:14:43.900
Do you know how many kilometers it is
to the local station?

00:14:43.900 --> 00:14:47.320
Um... Are you two high school students?

00:14:47.570 --> 00:14:52.660
A high school boy and girl
sharing one room is kind of... you know?

00:14:52.950 --> 00:14:55.660
- Th-That's ri—
- It's fine.

00:14:56.040 --> 00:14:57.660
We're brother and sister!

00:14:57.660 --> 00:14:58.870
<i>F-Furuhashi?</i>

00:14:59.120 --> 00:15:01.580
Oh, really?

00:15:01.580 --> 00:15:03.250
Right, Nariyuki?

00:15:03.250 --> 00:15:04.340
You...

00:15:04.340 --> 00:15:06.630
Nariyuki!

00:15:06.630 --> 00:15:09.840
Y-Yes, Big Sister Fumino.

00:15:12.300 --> 00:15:15.680
INN REGISTER OF NAMES
NARIYUKI YUIGA
FUMINO YUIGA

00:15:12.640 --> 00:15:15.220
<i>Fumino Yuiga.</i>

00:15:16.100 --> 00:15:17.890
<i>It feels kind of weird.</i>

00:15:19.270 --> 00:15:22.100
Hey, we really shouldn't be doing this!

00:15:22.100 --> 00:15:23.900
It's too late to back out now!

00:15:23.900 --> 00:15:27.150
It's fine. As long as we sleep
with our futons far apart.

00:15:27.360 --> 00:15:29.110
Oh dear.

00:15:29.400 --> 00:15:31.820
We've only got one futon in here.

00:15:32.240 --> 00:15:36.990
I'm sorry.
I'll lower the price of the room, of course.

00:15:36.990 --> 00:15:41.790
But since you're siblings...
I suppose you can make do, right?

00:15:41.920 --> 00:15:44.540
<i>Is this innkeeper testing us?</i>

00:15:52.760 --> 00:15:55.180
It was a nice bath, wasn't it?

00:15:55.800 --> 00:15:59.060
Y-Yeah. It was nice.

00:16:01.810 --> 00:16:05.900
<i>I don't know what to do.
I wish I'd brought study materials along.</i>

00:16:06.320 --> 00:16:07.190
Um...

00:16:07.780 --> 00:16:12.740
You use the futon, Furuhashi.
It's summer, so I'm fine sleeping on the floor.

00:16:13.450 --> 00:16:16.240
I-I can't let you do that! You use it, Yuiga!

00:16:16.240 --> 00:16:18.620
It's always been my dream
to sleep on tatami mats!

00:16:18.830 --> 00:16:21.710
- No way! What if you catch a cold?
- Same goes for you!

00:16:25.210 --> 00:16:27.960
It is cooler in the mountains...

00:16:28.460 --> 00:16:31.670
Should we just... get in the futon?

00:16:33.430 --> 00:16:38.140
I don't mean it in any strange way.
But it won't be funny if we both get sick!

00:16:38.140 --> 00:16:43.100
Besides, I know you're not the kind of person
who'd do anything weird.

00:16:43.350 --> 00:16:45.730
So I don't mind.

00:16:45.730 --> 00:16:47.820
I mean, if you don't mind.

00:16:48.230 --> 00:16:53.400
Well, as for me, I have a lot of siblings,
so I'm used to sharing a futon.

00:16:53.400 --> 00:16:57.490
So as long as you're okay with it,
Furuhashi, it's totally fine.

00:16:59.030 --> 00:17:01.410
<i>Yeah. Totally fine.</i>

00:17:03.120 --> 00:17:04.420
<i>Of course it isn't!</i>

00:17:04.420 --> 00:17:06.330
<i>Why does she smell so good?</i>

00:17:06.330 --> 00:17:08.210
<i>We used the same shampoo, right?</i>

00:17:09.000 --> 00:17:10.750
<i>Sharing a futon with a boy!</i>

00:17:10.750 --> 00:17:15.380
<i>It's not like we're touching, but I can feel
the heat radiating from Yuiga's back!</i>

00:17:17.300 --> 00:17:17.760
TOUCH

00:17:22.600 --> 00:17:26.940
<i>I can't do this!
I need to talk about something as a distraction!</i>

00:17:27.400 --> 00:17:28.900
<i>Topic, topic...</i>

00:17:32.150 --> 00:17:34.110
Furuhashi, the window...

00:17:46.080 --> 00:17:47.420
Beautiful!

00:17:47.420 --> 00:17:48.380
Yeah.

00:17:49.130 --> 00:17:52.300
Look, Yuiga! There's Libra!

00:17:52.630 --> 00:17:55.670
There's Kiffa Borealis, the Northern Scale Tray,

00:17:55.670 --> 00:18:00.430
and it's a little hard to see, but there's
Kiffa Australis, the Southern Scale Tray.

00:18:00.430 --> 00:18:01.350
<i>What?</i>

00:18:01.350 --> 00:18:05.390
Over there is Sagittarius's Rukbat,
Arkab, and Alnasl.

00:18:06.480 --> 00:18:09.150
You really do love stars, huh?

00:18:10.690 --> 00:18:11.520
Yeah.

00:18:12.360 --> 00:18:14.240
They're especially beautiful tonight.

00:18:15.110 --> 00:18:18.110
It's exactly like,
"The Lights in the Sky are Stars."

00:18:18.660 --> 00:18:22.410
Oh, um, there's an old book with that title.

00:18:23.160 --> 00:18:28.290
Basically, the main character
is a former astronaut who lost his dream,

00:18:28.290 --> 00:18:33.880
but at the age of 57, he chases
his dream of going back into space again.

00:18:34.590 --> 00:18:41.010
"Not physically, but if you let your soul soar,
you can even reach the stars in a moment."

00:18:41.180 --> 00:18:45.680
So a kind of spiritual teleportation
was in the book, too.

00:18:46.140 --> 00:18:50.690
Oh, Fumino.
That book is still too difficult for you.

00:18:50.810 --> 00:18:53.020
If I read it again and again, I'll understand!

00:18:53.980 --> 00:18:56.110
I loved that book.

00:19:00.410 --> 00:19:03.080
You're so cool, Furuhashi.

00:19:03.990 --> 00:19:05.830
Ogata and Takemoto too.

00:19:05.830 --> 00:19:07.910
Kominami-senpai as well.

00:19:07.910 --> 00:19:13.420
Chasing a dream to the point
of conquering your weakness is really cool.

00:19:13.670 --> 00:19:17.760
As for me, well,
I want my family to have a comfortable life,

00:19:17.760 --> 00:19:21.680
but it's not like
I have a specific dream of my own.

00:19:22.090 --> 00:19:24.850
To be honest, I'm envious.

00:19:27.270 --> 00:19:31.560
I don't think having a dream
is especially praiseworthy.

00:19:32.520 --> 00:19:33.940
But one day...

00:19:34.190 --> 00:19:37.780
if you ever do find something
that you really want to do,

00:19:37.780 --> 00:19:40.400
your big sister here will support you
with all her strength.

00:19:40.700 --> 00:19:41.700
Nariyuki.

00:19:42.030 --> 00:19:43.280
Just kidding.

00:19:45.450 --> 00:19:48.450
<i>Then what are you going to do
after entrance exams are over?</i>

00:19:49.160 --> 00:19:51.670
<i>When entrance exams are over...</i>

00:19:55.210 --> 00:19:57.670
<i>What I really want to do...</i>

00:20:01.430 --> 00:20:03.800
H-Hey, Furuhashi.

00:20:03.800 --> 00:20:05.220
She's sleeping?

00:20:09.140 --> 00:20:11.230
Mom...

00:20:13.440 --> 00:20:15.480
<i>Mom! Mom!</i>

00:20:15.980 --> 00:20:17.530
Listen, Fumino.

00:20:17.530 --> 00:20:20.820
I'm not going to disappear.

00:20:21.150 --> 00:20:26.080
I'm just going to teleport to the stars,
like they do in that book you like.

00:20:27.410 --> 00:20:30.540
I'll always be watching you from up there.

00:20:30.830 --> 00:20:32.750
So, Fumino...

00:20:33.330 --> 00:20:37.420
whenever there's a beautiful starry night,
be sure to find me, okay?

00:20:38.500 --> 00:20:43.590
<i>They're a little cold,
but comforting, as they gently hold my hands.</i>

00:20:44.340 --> 00:20:47.260
<i>Oh. These are Mom's hands.</i>

00:21:28.510 --> 00:21:34.020
<i>T-Too embarrassing! I know we were exhausted
last night, but how could we do that?</i>

00:21:34.100 --> 00:21:36.600
<i>When I woke up, I was super embracing her!</i>

00:21:36.600 --> 00:21:39.610
<i>I'm sorry, Furuhashi! I'm really sorry!</i>

00:21:39.610 --> 00:21:44.860
<i>It's not what you think, okay?
Ri, Uruka, don't get the wrong idea!</i>

00:23:23.880 --> 00:23:26.260
Well, I go this way.

00:23:26.710 --> 00:23:27.670
Yeah.

00:23:29.130 --> 00:23:30.300
Yuiga.

00:23:32.890 --> 00:23:34.050
I'll see you.

00:23:36.390 --> 00:23:39.980
TO BE CONTINUED
